{
  "$schema": "ruse-mod/v1",
  "id": "ruse-pinnacle-map-pack-v1",
  "name": "Pinnacle Map Pack",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "Prolution & Minibug",
  "description": "This version is a complete overhaul of the RUSE Campaign Map Pack and contains the following maps: Colditz Castle, North Africa, The Battle of Monte Cassino, Italy, France (A New D-Day Map), A Bridge Too Far, Romeo & The Red Devils (Market Garden/Holland Campaign Map), The Siege of Bastogne (Up to 8 Players), Best Foes (A New Handshake Over the Elbe Map), West Meets East (A New Handshake Over the Elbe Map) and Germany (Into the Bear's Jaws Campaign Map)\n\nWelcome,\nThe map pack has been completely redesigned and rebuilt from scratch.\n\nHow to play!\na). Launch multiplayer or battles lobby -> map selection -> map pack maps are all the way to the right\n---\nCredits\nDesigned and Created by Prolution and Minibug",
  "game_version": "23738184",
